# CI and merge

Nothing merges on red CI. Required gates: **tests**, **ruff**, **mypy**, **schema validation**, **pip-audit**, and **gitleaks**.

Do not skip, ignore, or weaken a gate to land a change. Review every PR against `.github/pull_request_template.md`.
